  router.get('/api/health', async () => ({ status: 'ok', service: 'app-backend', time: new Date().toISOString() }));
  registerTrainingJobs(router, { env });
  return http.createServer(async (req, res) => { ... });
}
```
Caveat for the contract: the existing health route returns `{ status:'ok', service, time }`, while `contract.md` specifies `GET /api/health → { ok: true }`.

